     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Hi, Robert.  That’s great.  I’m ccing stan-users to spread the news.<div>A<br><div><br><div><div>On Mar 31, 2014, at 7:44 PM, Grant, Robert L &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Robert...@sgul.kingston.ac.uk</a>&gt; wrote:</div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div lang=\"EN-GB\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:10px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"><div><div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></div><div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">I thought you’d be interested to hear I had an abstract accepted today for JSM with a simulation study of a Bayesian meta-analysis setup (really a structural equation model approach). This just would not have been feasible without Stan! And rstan, come to that. So thanks for that too!<u></u><u></u></div><div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></div><div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Robert<u></u><u></u></div><div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><u></u> <u></u></div><div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span>--<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span>   Robert Grant<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span>   Senior Lecturer in Health &amp; Social Care Statistics<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span>   St George’s, University of London &amp; Kingston University<u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span>  <span> </span><a href style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">robert...@sgul.kingston.ac.uk</a><u></u><u></u></span></div><div style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span>  <span> </span><a href=\"http://www.robertgrantstats.co.uk\" style=\"color:purple;text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.robertgrantstats.co.uk&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466752690000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3J5rUmkMUae7C9hwNjwKAH\">http://www.robertgrantstats.co.uk</a></span></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div></div>"
